{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの日記ですひめたんです。\n若月さんに砂肝ジャーキーを献上した中元です。\nだってお腹空いたって言ったからー♪\nあれは横浜の駄菓子屋さんで見つけた、甘い物を我慢した結果です。\nほんまに美味しいよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～早く本題に突っ込んじゃおーっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、当分のあいだ日記をおやすみしててごめんなさい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑だよ。どうでしたかな(・∀・)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとはまだまだあるんぢゃけど、そろそろひめたんブログも\n恋しくなったころではないかなー？\nっていうか、ひめたんが恋しいので(//∀//)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きはまたの機会に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はひめきゅん♪のみなさんに大事なご報告!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん!\n無事志望高に合格しました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/31/himeka0059.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさーんの方からいただいた応援のおかげですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生んなったら今まで以上に勉強も大変になるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b